# Optional. When both are set at build time, the dashboard reads published
# runs from Postgres schema dfperf (anon / publishable key only — never
# service_role). GitHub Pages uses Actions secrets with these exact names.
# The Supabase Data API must expose schema dfperf. If either variable is
# unset, the UI falls back to ./data JSON (npm run sync / build / preview)
# or, in `npm run dev`, results/dfperf.db.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
